{"id":59207,"date":"2026-08-13T07:22:28","date_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:22:28","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:51:03","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:51:03","slug":"corrida-dos-reis-bencao-do-atleta","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-dos-reis-bencao-do-atleta\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>10 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), na cidade de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>). Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta no passeio pedonal da <strong>Avenida Dom Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva<\/strong> (entre a Rotunda de Santo Ant\u00f3nio e o <strong>Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima<\/strong>), o programa inicia-se com a tradicional <strong>B\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o dos Atletas \u00e0s 09:00<\/strong>, seguida da <strong>Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>, da <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:35<\/strong> e da <strong>Corrida Jovem<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>12:30<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Disputada no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, a Cidade da Paz situada no planalto da <strong>Serra de Aire<\/strong>, a prova percorre as amplas avenidas urbanas na envolvente do <strong>Santu\u00e1rio de F\u00e1tima<\/strong> e do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Papa Francisco<\/strong> (onde funcionam os balne\u00e1rios de apoio aos participantes). A corrida principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> possui um tempo limite de <strong>1h45<\/strong> e conta com um m\u00e1ximo de 1200 vagas (mais 400 vagas para a Caminhada e 400 para a Corrida Jovem).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>FET &#8211; F\u00e1tima Escola de Triatlo<\/strong> com o apoio institucional da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui kit de atleta, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos, refor\u00e7o final, brindes e banhos, com op\u00e7\u00e3o de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (+9,00 \u20ac) e desconto de 1,00 \u20ac para atletas federados FPA nos 10 km. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida Dom Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva (junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima), Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km, Caminhada 7 km e Corrida Jovem<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">FET &#8211; F\u00e1tima Escola de Triatlo, Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima e Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1h45<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1ZRoWTpihnb5NwRIcs4ESgnnisrgVjZzP\/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Principal 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 7 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Jovem (Benjamins a Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 12:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios da 8\u00aa Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, dia 10 de janeiro de 2027, no passeio pedonal da Avenida Dom Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva (junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima, concelho de Our\u00e9m). O programa inclui a B\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o dos Atletas \u00e0s 09:00, a partida da Corrida Principal de 10 km \u00e0s 09:30, a Caminhada de 7 km \u00e0s 09:35 e a Corrida Jovem \u00e0s 12:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida Principal de 10 km (limite de 1200 vagas), o valor \u00e9 de 12,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13 de dezembro de 2026 e de 15,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 27 de dezembro de 2026 (atletas federados na FPA beneficiam de 1,00 \u20ac de desconto). A Caminhada de 7 km (400 vagas) tem um custo \u00fanico de 8,00 \u20ac e a Corrida Jovem (400 vagas) \u00e9 gratuita mediante inscri\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria. A t-shirt t\u00e9cnica opcional tem um custo de 9,00 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam o secretariado e os balne\u00e1rios para banhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de dorsais decorre no Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima no s\u00e1bado (9 de janeiro) das 15:00 \u00e0s 20:00 e no domingo (10 de janeiro) a partir das 07:30 (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 12:15 para a prova jovem). Os banhos s\u00e3o disponibilizados nos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Papa Francisco, em F\u00e1tima.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite dos 10 km e a que horas s\u00e3o entregues os pr\u00e9mios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite para concluir a Corrida Principal de 10 km \u00e9 de 1h45. A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios da prova principal realiza-se a partir das 12:00 e a da prova jovem \u00e0s 14:30, junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a 8\u00aa Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo FET &#8211; F\u00e1tima Escola de Triatlo, contando com a parceria institucional da Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima e do Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida Dom Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva (junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Our\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 8\u00aa Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027 realiza-se a 10 de janeiro em F\u00e1tima, Our\u00e9m. Corrida de 10 km, Caminhada 7 km e Prova Jovem. Faz a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-dos-reis-bencao-do-atleta.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida Principal 10 km\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.recordepessoal.pt\/evento\/8corridadosreis-bencaodoatleta\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 7 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.recordepessoal.pt\/evento\/8corridadosreis-bencaodoatleta\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida Jovem (Benjamins a Juvenis)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.recordepessoal.pt\/evento\/8corridadosreis-bencaodoatleta\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"FET - F\u00e1tima Escola de Triatlo, Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima e Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios da 8\u00aa Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, dia 10 de janeiro de 2027, no passeio pedonal da Avenida Dom Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva (junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima, concelho de Our\u00e9m). O programa inclui a B\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o dos Atletas \u00e0s 09:00, a partida da Corrida Principal de 10 km \u00e0s 09:30, a Caminhada de 7 km \u00e0s 09:35 e a Corrida Jovem \u00e0s 12:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Corrida Principal de 10 km (limite de 1200 vagas), o valor \u00e9 de 12,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13 de dezembro de 2026 e de 15,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 27 de dezembro de 2026 (atletas federados na FPA beneficiam de 1,00 \u20ac de desconto). A Caminhada de 7 km (400 vagas) tem um custo \u00fanico de 8,00 \u20ac e a Corrida Jovem (400 vagas) \u00e9 gratuita mediante inscri\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria. A t-shirt t\u00e9cnica opcional tem um custo de 9,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funcionam o secretariado e os balne\u00e1rios para banhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento de dorsais decorre no Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima no s\u00e1bado (9 de janeiro) das 15:00 \u00e0s 20:00 e no domingo (10 de janeiro) a partir das 07:30 (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 12:15 para a prova jovem). Os banhos s\u00e3o disponibilizados nos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Papa Francisco, em F\u00e1tima.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite dos 10 km e a que horas s\u00e3o entregues os pr\u00e9mios?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite para concluir a Corrida Principal de 10 km \u00e9 de 1h45. A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios da prova principal realiza-se a partir das 12:00 e a da prova jovem \u00e0s 14:30, junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a 8\u00aa Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo FET - F\u00e1tima Escola de Triatlo, contando com a parceria institucional da Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima e do Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70443,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-59207","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ourem-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-dos-reis-bencao-do-atleta.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/59207","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=59207"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/59207\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70444,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/59207\/revisions\/70444"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70443"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=59207"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=59207"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=59207"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.